WEBVTT

00:12:59.676 --> 00:13:01.215
i krivolova.

00:13:01.239 --> 00:13:03.277
(Pljesak)

00:13:03.301 --> 00:13:04.855
Hvala vam.

00:13:04.879 --> 00:13:08.295
Možemo pogledati naše
najbliže rođake majmune,

00:13:08.319 --> 00:13:11.285
znamo da žaluju, znamo da imaju osjećaje,

00:13:11.309 --> 00:13:13.806
i ne zaslužuju biti primorani

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.139
biti dio invazivnih
biomedicinskih eksperimenata,

00:13:17.163 --> 00:13:18.774
i to godinama.

00:13:19.393 --> 00:13:20.546
I znate...

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.808
(Pljesak)

00:13:21.832 --> 00:13:25.310
patke Harper i Kohl
su nam također nešto pokazale.

00:13:25.334 --> 00:13:28.980
Pomogle su nam da spojimo točke
i shvatimo da ono što jedemo

00:13:29.004 --> 00:13:31.246
utječe na način kako životinje žive.